  <title>Check that your files are protected</title>
  <desc>What the main window and the notifications tell you.</desc>

  <p>Open <app>Delta</app> from the Activities overview. It answers one question: are my files protected?
  When all is well it says <gui>Your files are protected</gui>, when the last backup was made and when the next one is due.
  <gui style="button">Back up now</gui> starts a copy straight away. The <gui style="button">Backup history</gui> button
  lists your backups, and <gui style="menu">Main menu</gui> has <gui style="menuitem">Preferences</gui> and
  <gui style="menuitem">About Delta</gui>.</p>

  <table frame="all" rules="rows">
    <thead>
      <tr><td><p>You see</p></td><td><p>It means</p></td></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><p><gui>Backups are not set up</gui></p></td><td><p>There is no destination yet. Choose <gui style="button">Set up backups</gui>.</p></td></tr>
      <tr><td><p><gui>Backing up…</gui></p></td><td><p>A copy is running. You can keep working.</p></td></tr>
      <tr><td><p><gui>A backup is open as a folder</gui></p></td><td><p>You opened a backup with <link xref="browse-folder"/>. The next copy waits until you close it.</p></td></tr>
      <tr><td><p><gui>The backup repository is locked</gui></p></td><td><p>See <link xref="troubleshooting#locked"/>.</p></td></tr>
      <tr><td><p><gui>The last backup failed</gui></p></td><td><p>Choose <gui style="button">Try again</gui>, then see <link xref="troubleshooting"/>.</p></td></tr>
      <tr><td><p><gui>The backup service is not available</gui></p></td><td><p>See <link xref="troubleshooting#service"/>.</p></td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>Delta also sends notifications: <gui>Backup in progress</gui>, <gui>Backup complete</gui>,
  <gui>Backup complete with warnings</gui>, <gui>Backup interrupted</gui> (Delta resumes it by itself),
  <gui>Backup postponed</gui> and <gui>Backup failed</gui>.</p>
</page>
